{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"norway-parental-benefit-planner UI copy.example","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"norway-parental-benefit-planner.copy.example","keys":["norway-parental-benefit-planner.copy.example"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ga wani yaro haife a ZXQPH0000QXZ Nuwamba ZXQPH0001QXZ, da standard NAV lokacin da iyaye biyu da kwarewa ne ZXQPH0002QXZ makonni a ZXQPH0003QXZ ko ZXQPH0004QXZ makonni da ZXQPH0005QXZ rana a ZXQPH0006QXZ. The ZXQPH0007QXZ zaɓi gabaɗaya shafa biyan kudi a kan mafi tsawo lokaci; NAV ya ce yawan biyan kudi ne kusan daidai.","record_id":"f84d6d738f9de0da96938fb1e4cedbc68a41d539861460d3b8d07d6f3b1d2755","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.243015207250096,"source":"For one child born on 1 November 2026, the standard NAV period when both parents qualify is 49 weeks at 100% or 61 weeks and 1 day at 80%. The 80% choice generally spreads payments over longer time; NAV says the total payment is approximately equal.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"e17880128eda76f798d6ecbd64e5e32d3cfe82c4b4d6f2a85623710fc3e299ee","status":"needs-review","translation":"Ga wani yaro haife a 1 Nuwamba 2026, da standard NAV lokacin da iyaye biyu da kwarewa ne 49 makonni a 100% ko 61 makonni da 1 rana a 80%. The 80% zaɓi gabaɗaya shafa biyan kudi a kan mafi tsawo lokaci; NAV ya ce yawan biyan kudi ne kusan daidai.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
